  "slug": "almond-butter",
  "name": "Almond Butter",
  "recipe_type": "side",
  "brief_description": "This is a quick, simple way to make healthy, all-natural basic almond butter. Add sugar, spices, or other ingredients to taste if desired.",
  "cuisine": null,
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Place the almonds in a food processor. Process on high until ground almonds begin to form a ball. Drizzle olive oil over almonds and continue to process, stopping occasionally to scrape sides of the bowl with a spatula as needed. Store in an airtight container."
    }
